  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Bir `Counter` aç; yorumları dolaşırken her kelimeyi `words[w] += 1` ile say.",
      "en": "Start a `Counter`; while looping over the reviews, count each word with `words[w] += 1`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Kelime: `w.strip(\".,!?\")`, metin: `r[\"text\"].lower().split()`.",
      "en": "The word: `w.strip(\".,!?\")`, the text: `r[\"text\"].lower().split()`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n**main.py**\n\n```python\nfrom collections import Counter\nfrom text_data import make_reviews\n\n\ndef top_words(n, label, k):\n    words = Counter()\n    for r in make_reviews(n):\n        if r[\"label\"] == label:\n            for w in r[\"text\"].lower().split():\n                words[w.strip(\".,!?\")] += 1\n    return words.most_common(k)\n\nfor word, count in top_words(1000, \"negative\", 5):\n    print(word, count)\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n**main.py**\n\n```python\nfrom collections import Counter\nfrom text_data import make_reviews\n\n\ndef top_words(n, label, k):\n    words = Counter()\n    for r in make_reviews(n):\n        if r[\"label\"] == label:\n            for w in r[\"text\"].lower().split():\n                words[w.strip(\".,!?\")] += 1\n    return words.most_common(k)\n\nfor word, count in top_words(1000, \"negative\", 5):\n    print(word, count)\n```"
    }
  ],
